### Request a trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "riderId": 1,
  "pickupLat": 12.9700,
  "pickupLng": 77.5900,
  "dropLat": 12.9500,
  "dropLng": 77.6200
}

### Get trip
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rides/{{tripId}}

### Start trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides/{{tripId}}/start

### Complete trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides/{{tripId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

75.50

### Pay for trip
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tripId": {{tripId}},
  "amount": 75.50,
  "method": "CASH"
}
